
---

# `.gitignore`

برای پروژه C# / ASP.NET Core این را بگذار:

```gitignore
# Build output
bin/
obj/

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# Rider / JetBrains
.idea/
*.sln.iml

# Visual Studio Code
.vscode/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Test results
TestResults/
*.trx

# NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

# Logs
*.log

# Local configuration
appsettings.Development.json

# User-specific files
*.rsuser